# Citation metadata for Montana Mesonet data (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# GitHub's "Cite this repository" button reads this file.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Montana Mesonet data, please cite them as: Montana Mesonet,
  Montana Climate Office. A service of the University of Montana.
  {Year Accessed}. Data accessed from {URL} on {Access Date}.
  Licensed CC BY 4.0.
type: dataset
title: "Montana Mesonet"
abstract: >-
  Weather, soil, and station observations from the Montana Mesonet, a network
  of stations across Montana operated by the Montana Climate Office. A service
  of the University of Montana.
authors:
  - name: "Montana Climate Office, University of Montana"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://climate.umt.edu/mesonet/"
repository: "https://data2.climate.umt.edu/mesonet/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mt-climate-office/mesonet-license"
keywords:
  - Montana Mesonet
  - weather
  - soil moisture
  - Montana
